  "description": "<p>Automated, machine-readable bibliographic metadata catalog (CSV and JSONL) indexing <strong>32,984</strong> official primary and secondary laws, final and proposed rules, statutory instruments, and multilateral resolutions across <strong>549</strong> government departments, ministries, regulatory agencies, and multilateral organs across active jurisdictions: <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/united-states/'>United States</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/united-kingdom/'>United Kingdom</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/canada/'>Canada</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/european-union/'>European Union</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/australia/'>Australia</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/united-nations/'>United Nations</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/ireland/'>Ireland</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/germany/'>Germany</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/international/'>International</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/austria/'>Austria</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/switzerland/'>Switzerland</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/finland/'>Finland</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/france/'>France</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/norway/'>Norway</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/italy/'>Italy</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/poland/'>Poland</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/south-africa/'>South Africa</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/india/'>India</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/belgium/'>Belgium</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/brazil/'>Brazil</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/denmark/'>Denmark</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/japan/'>Japan</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/south-korea/'>South Korea</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/netherlands/'>Netherlands</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/russia/'>Russia</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/sweden/'>Sweden</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/singapore/'>Singapore</a>.</p><p>Full plain-English executive briefings, structured HTML compliance matrices, semantic definition lists, two-stage Tables of Contents, authority RSS syndication feeds, and unabridged source PDF dossiers are accessible via each record's canonical URL on <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/'>https://www.globaldataindex.org</a> and the <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/methodology/'>Complete Issuing Authority Directory</a>.</p>",
